	"description": "P25: the Aldmere March's skeleton and light content (plan M6-M9 §5.4, §5.10). P36 (plan M6-M9 §3.20, §5.4, §5.7, §5.9, §5.13): Fort Aldmere made the crown's oath - its curtain wall with the gate bastions where the garrison's wall archers and ballistae stand, the real gate (breached at stage 4, opened by a parley), the keep and its steps (the Last Stand), the inner portcullis and the Iron Regiment's battle in the bailey (FortBattle), the parley horn where Warlord Corvane answers from his wall, the fort forge (titan tier: parley or a spared Corvane), four wall ballistae; the war camp's four engines and the herald at its edge; Ballista Ridge's three ballistae; the deserters' hiding place; the ridge eyrie's sealed cairn; the quests' markers, flee points and safe markers.",
