		{"kind": "arena", "style": "battle", "id": "world.aldmere.iron_regiment_arena", "pos": [650, -165], "inner_radius": 72, "floor": [[560, -245], [740, -95]], "engage_area": "world.area.fort_bailey", "engage": {"at": [650, -113], "size": [24, 14, 10], "yaw": 0}, "gate": {"at": [650, -99], "size": [18, 13, 2], "yaw": 0}, "battle_id": "battle.iron_regiment", "battle_name": "The Iron Regiment", "phases": [{"id": "wall", "name": "The Wall", "below": 1.0, "encounters": ["encounter.aldmere_iron_regiment_wall"]}, {"id": "charge", "name": "The Charge", "below": 0.7, "encounters": ["encounter.aldmere_iron_regiment_charge"]}, {"id": "last_stand", "name": "The Last Stand", "below": 0.5, "encounters": ["encounter.aldmere_iron_regiment_stand"]}], "engines": ["world.aldmere.fort_ballista_w", "world.aldmere.fort_ballista_e", "world.aldmere.fort_ballista_nw", "world.aldmere.fort_ballista_ne"], "commander_id": "world.aldmere.corvane", "guard_formation": "guard", "stand_out": ["encounter.aldmere_fort_gate"], "defeated_flag": "boss.corvane.defeated", "peace_condition": {"type": "flag", "flag": "oath.crown.outcome", "equals": "parley"}, "settled_flag": "boss.corvane.outcome", "faction": "aldmere", "open_flag": "world.aldmere.fort_open", "note": "The inner portcullis drops behind a giant that enters the bailey past the breached gate; the waystone world.cp.fort_gate stands 40 m outside the arena. M8 gate (F8): the arena is the bailey inside the curtain wall (floor: its corners), so the disengage rule measures from the walls, not from a circle that cut through the corners. M9 confirmation (W23, a layout defect): the Charge at 0.7 and the Last Stand at 0.5 (were 0.6 and 0.25) - the four ballistae (3,600) and the two inner crews count in the bar and stand through the Charge (plan 5.13), so the Wall's fall left the bar at 0.622 (desktop) / 0.670 (web) and the Charge's at 0.452 / 0.465: each phase now begins once the phases before it fall with the engines and their crews standing (test_aldmere_stonehold_content)."},
